        "original_id": "25cbaf9d-7e71-5ad4-8d5a-7b5b6db931d5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Theodor Jensen\n- Music Groups: The Hives, Broder Daniel, The Plan\n- Albums: Barely Legal\n- Places: Sweden, Fagersta, Gothenburg\n- Topics: Swedish rock, alternative rock, garage rock revival\n\nFacts:\n- Broder Daniel was an alternative rock band from Gothenburg, Sweden.\n- In 2000, The Plan was formed by Theodor Jensen, who had been a guitarist and later bass player in Broder Daniel.\n- The Hives are a Swedish rock band that rose to prominence in the early 2000s during the garage rock revival.\n- Barely Legal is the debut studio album by the Swedish rock band The Hives, which is from Fagersta, Sweden.",
